e='text'>As Serrato was screaming for help inside his burni...</title><content type='html'>As Serrato was screaming for help inside his burning home&lt;br /&gt;the police responded with &amp;quot;stop resisting!&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;SWAT training motto: &amp;quot;A man&amp;#39;s home is his coffin.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7548814426351200706/comments/default/4958902365273402880'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7548814426351200706/comments/default/4958902365273402880'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/killing-without-consequences-counter.html?showComment=1377268434164#c4958902365273402880' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/killing-without-consequences-counter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7548814426351200706' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7548814426351200706' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1075364918"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 23, 2013 at 8:33 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2034632190823156459</id><published>2013-08-22T15:07:00.402-06:00</published><updated>2013-08-22T15:07:00.402-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;...once that fire began, the assailants took...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;...once that fire began, the assailants took no action to rescue the victim, and impeded the efforts of others to do so...&amp;quot;  you also state the screams of the occupant could be heard.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;-----------------------------&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;#39;officialdom&amp;#39; lets a human being suffocate with smoke inhalation, or actually burn to death...suffocate, or burn...to live and be tried before one&amp;#39;s peers not being among the &amp;#39;choices&amp;#39; of officialdom&amp;#39;s enforcers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;absolutely disgusting...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;excessively despicable...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;monstrously sociopathic...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;psychologically pathologic...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;bereft of any morality...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the above &amp;#39;qualities&amp;#39; bespeaking of a nation whose enforcers have become what that same nation reviled as evil when done in europe, asia, africa and latin america in centuries and decades past.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;what has been &amp;#39;practiced&amp;#39; in the international arena is coming home to the domestic arena and is being applied more frequently and more aggressively.  night time raids now, drone strikes in the future.&lt;br /&gt;laugh now.  pay later.  dearly.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;we have allowed the wind to be sown in our name...the whirlwind we are beginning to reap.  &amp;#39;good men&amp;#39; have said and done nothing for too long.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the ultimate price steepens daily. reality demands satisfaction.  the price reality will extract will be beyond what most can imagine.  it cannot be avoided.  there will be a trigger, things will go south and the enforcers will come out in numbers.  the true nature of the state will be revealed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;when searching for a cause, look, first, around you, then, second, if the shoe fits, in the mirror.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;so be it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7548814426351200706/comments/default/2034632190823156459'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7548814426351200706/comments/default/2034632190823156459'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/killing-without-consequences-counter.html?showComment=1377205620402#c2034632190823156459' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/08/killing-without-consequences-counter.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7548814426351200706' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7548814426351200706' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-306670635"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 22, 2013 at 3:07 PM"/></entry></feed>